Subject: [PATCH 3/5] A timeline's first view renders no overscan rows until
 the reader's first wheel, touch or pointer press raises the band to 6, so
 opening or returning to a session at its latest turn mounts only the rows on
 screen and no longer lays out the off-screen row above a tall reply, which in
